                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Very belatedly falling in love with the Spiderweb Software offerings and have played Avadon 1 and 2 until I hit a wall around level 20 but number 3 has proved the best (for me) so far.\n\nMemorable story lines and love the choices being made over whether to back the deposed Avadon Keeper Redbeard or the Council approved replacement Potus.\n\nThey are an escapist delight to play with numerous mutually antagonistic factions and a rich world with expertly written dialogue.\n\nHighly recommended",
